    "description": "Training Dataset for TrailScan Model \"Thuringia\". This Dataset contains normalized 4-band raster images of forest regions in the German federal state of Thuringia. The raster images have been created from airborne laserscanning data processed with the 'Preprocessing Tool' of the 'QGIS TrailScan Plugin'. Additionally, skid trails have been digitized and rasterized als label-images.",
